<title>USA: Chrysler Corp sells $600 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Chrysler Corp sells $600 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Chrysler Corp was priced on Wednesday via lead manager Salomon Brothers, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHRYSLER CORP</p>
<p>AMT $600 MLN	 COUPON 7.45 PCT   MATURITY 3/1/2027</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.514  FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.491 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 69 BPS     MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT 18</p>
<p>							 BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>((U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
